      "mathematical_operation": "scale*exp(-0.5*(u\u00b2/sx\u00b2+v\u00b2/sy\u00b2))*cos(2*pi*fx*u), rotated coordinates u=cos(theta)*x-sin(theta)*y, v=cos(theta)*y+sin(theta)*x",
